#X text 587 635 The sounds can be nice but need a lot more movement to become interesting.;
#X text 594 687 With the setup above \, though \, even though there is no modulation to the oscillations or the volume \, there can be beats between the oscillators.;
#X text 27 7 This version allows for finer control over the frequencies. However \, in this state \, it does not change when the finer control changes. IN ORDER TO GET THE finer frequency control to make the changes \, the change of that slider has to send a trigger \, in this case \, a [bang] \, to the hot inlet of a [+] object. This is because sending a number to a COLD INLET does not cause the [+] object to do the addition. The HOT INLET does. I had to go back to the SSR440.pd patch in my Local_externals library to see how that worked. See another repository if no in the one that contains this patch.;
#X msg 1390 49 \; pd dsp \$1;
